{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天做一件事",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 82.1,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 3.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "项目方和交易所，列出每个签名人的设备和云账户，看有没有两个人共用。",
   "spoken": "项目方和交易所，列出每个签名人的设备和云账户，看有没有两个人共用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.9,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 3.992,
   "speechEnd": 10.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "钱包开发者，确认日志和崩溃上报屏蔽密钥材料，发布凭证开启多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "钱包开发者，确认日志和崩溃上报屏蔽密钥材料，发布凭证开启多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.44,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 10.532,
   "speechEnd": 17.99
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "运维负责人，人员离职或漏洞披露后，轮换密钥，并撤销链上权限。",
   "spoken": "运维负责人，人员离职或漏洞批路后，轮换密钥，并撤销链上权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 18.42,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 18.42,
   "speechEnd": 24.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "备份要和主密钥分开放，每年至少演练一次恢复，恢复要多人参与。",
   "spoken": "备份要和主密钥分开放，每年至少演练一次恢复，恢复要多人参与。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 24.96,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 25.057,
   "speechEnd": 30.437
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，大额放硬件钱包，小额放另一个钱包，两个钱包用不同的助记词。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，大额放硬件钱包，小额放另一个钱包，两个钱包用不同的助记词。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 30.86,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 30.952,
   "speechEnd": 37.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "助记词只写在纸或金属板上，不拍照，不存云笔记。",
   "spoken": "助记词只写在纸或金属板上，不拍照，不存云笔记。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 37.8,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 37.8,
   "speechEnd": 42.427
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "任何客服、网站、表单让你输入助记词，都是诈骗。",
   "spoken": "任何客服、网站、表单让你输入助记词，都是诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 42.82,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 42.911,
   "speechEnd": 47.873
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "硬件钱包屏幕只显示哈希，或者无法解析，就不签。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包屏幕只显示哈希，或者无法解析，就不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 48.32,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 48.32,
   "speechEnd": 52.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 52.86,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 52.86,
   "speechEnd": 54.041
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "六把私钥都没泄露，攻击者也能转走资金。",
   "spoken": "六把私钥都没泄露，攻击者也能转走资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 54.44,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 54.53,
   "speechEnd": 57.678
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "只要签名人看到的和实际签下的不一样，每把钥匙都会照常签名。",
   "spoken": "只要签名人看到的和实际签下的不一样，每把钥匙都会照常签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 58.1,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 58.1,
   "speechEnd": 64.172
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "能挡住它的，是每个签名人在自己的设备上独立解码，核对屏幕上的字段。",
   "spoken": "能挡住它的，是每个签名人在自己的设备上独立解码，核对屏幕上的字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 64.64,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 64.743,
   "speechEnd": 70.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "这只在签名人真正独立时成立。",
   "spoken": "这只在签名人真正独立时成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 71.18,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 71.277,
   "speechEnd": 73.736
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "钥匙放在哪里很重要，签下的是什么，同样重要。",
   "spoken": "钥匙放在哪里很重要，签下的是什么，同样重要。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-14.wav",
   "start": 74.2,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 74.2,
   "speechEnd": 78.358
  },
  {
